1
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:34,820
All of the air!

2
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:37,780
It seems to be flowing over to Wamu!

3
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,100
My ultimate mastery!

4
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:44,380
Atmospheric rift!

5
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,780
That's only wind!

6
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,977
I know you're near the flame.

7
00:01:55,060 --> 00:01:59,000
I sense it, though I can't
see exactly where that is.

8
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,580
But I am going to find you eventually.

9
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:05,577
Now that I've prevented you from
gathering your Hormone energy,

10
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:07,366
I'm going to cut you in half!

11
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:12,320
Atmospheric Rift is Wamuu's
supreme final weapon.

12
00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:17,120
The pipes he uses to cloak himself
take in huge amounts of air,

13
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:19,680
and then unbelievably compress it.

14
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:23,491
The air is then blasted from
an orifice thinner than paper.

15
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,060
It is a razor made of wind.

16
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:32,100
But it creates heat and friction
at levels terrible even for Wamuu.

17
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,520
His body cannot handle it.

18
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,280
He is falling apart.

19
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:40,720
But he is certainly a breathtaking
figure, tragic and heroic.

20
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,440
Victory is yours, Wamuu.

21
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:47,100
Take his life as a bomb
for your wound. Shoujo!

22
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:49,620
It's getting close!

23
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,357
Time to pull off one of
my famous tricks now!

24
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:55,500
Now, this one's called
the Hormon Oil Trick.

25
00:02:56,260 --> 00:02:59,560
His lungs are literally
high-pressure oxygen tanks.

26
00:03:00,460 --> 00:03:05,297
Those pipes, if I can only hit
them, he'd inhale the flaming oil?

27
00:03:05,380 --> 00:03:08,262
which in turn would create
an internal explosion.

28
00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:11,420
But this is the very
last ace up my sleeve.

29
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:12,900
If I mess it up.

30
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:16,050
Got you now.

31
00:03:16,133 --> 00:03:18,520
Your life is mine. Damn it!

32
00:03:18,940 --> 00:03:20,540
Take this, Wamu!

33
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:24,270
Ugh!

34
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,340
That's your choice, fool.

35
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:33,911
I can sense anything that is
far enough away from the fire.

36
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,620
You're out of tricks.

37
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:39,340
And that cry of yours
gave away your position.

38
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:41,440
And now...

39
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:44,320
Atmospheric Rift!

40
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:45,950
Seize!

41
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:50,320
Lend me your strength!

42
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,600
Another fire attack.

43
00:03:53,140 --> 00:03:55,480
I told you I can sense these things.

44
00:03:58,460 --> 00:04:02,360
And now, I will cut you in
half to claim my victory.

45
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,190
Jojo, no!

46
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:06,080
Now, he has finally won.

47
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:12,220
Wamu, let me tell you
exactly when you lost.

48
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:14,680
It was when I threw Caesar's scarf.

49
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:16,980
Don't you get it?

50
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:20,237
I meant for you to cut the
bottle in half the entire time.

51
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:25,120
Your ability to do it so quickly and
easily is what led to your downfall.

52
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:29,200
The oil inside of it is now vaporizing.

53
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:31,620
And look, you see the bandana?

54
00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:33,566
All the pieces flying around?

55
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:38,540
Every little fragment is still on
fire, and they're entering my body.

56
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:43,780
Wamu, you have been a worthy
and admirable fighter.

57
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:49,680
But a powerful ally named Caesar
was with me throughout this contest.

58
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,150
Uh-huh.

59
00:04:59,100 --> 00:05:00,560
He was defeated.

60
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:03,360
Lord Wamu, how could he have lost?

61
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,717
Jojo, be careful, he can regenerate.

62
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,212
even like that after being blown to bits.

63
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:24,224
You have to use your strongest
hormone to destroy him completely.

64
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:31,640
So it is finally over now.

65
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,280
Joe, Joe.

66
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:37,120
It is.

67
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:40,080
You took revenge for Caesar.

68
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,900
Yes, I did.

69
00:05:42,620 --> 00:05:43,920
Then go ahead.

70
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,520
Finish it.

71
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,630
I will!

72
00:06:02,180 --> 00:06:03,820
What is going on?

73
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:07,040
That smoke isn't from the flaming oil.

74
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,980
It's coming from your wounds.

75
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:12,897
The hormone from your
arms spread through you.

76
00:06:12,980 --> 00:06:14,777
Every part of you is infected now.

77
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:16,297
You are dissolving.

78
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:18,817
I can only imagine the agony you feel.

79
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:21,657
I can't prevent you from dying now.

80
00:06:21,740 --> 00:06:22,737
but there's this.

81
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:25,117
my blood can at least ease your pain.

82
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:27,437
why do you want to shame me?

83
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:30,357
I have made peace with myself. stop.

84
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:32,457
I don't need pity from you.

85
00:06:32,540 --> 00:06:34,157
is that what you think?

86
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:37,597
that this is done out of pity for you? no.

87
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:42,257
why didn't you destroy Caesar's bubble of
blood that carried his bandana and ring?

88
00:06:42,340 --> 00:06:43,170
knowing

89
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:46,037
full will that they posed
a serious threat to you.

90
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,317
Was that pity?

91
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:49,240
It was because the man

92
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:52,660
was a worthy and noble warrior.

93
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:55,057
He deserved to be honored for that.

94
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:58,257
What you'll say next is,
Jojo, you can't mean...

95
00:06:58,340 --> 00:07:00,777
Jojo, you can't mean...

96
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:02,300
Yes, I do, Wamu.

97
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,600
The honor you showed my friend,

98
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:08,737
Caesar's warrior spirit,
had earned your respect.

99
00:07:08,820 --> 00:07:12,879
So in return, I wanted to find a
way to honor By your warrior spirit,

100
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,680
my blood is a tribute to you.

101
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,920
You beat me, Jojo.

102
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:26,020
And as a warrior, it would now appear
that you stand taller than I do.

103
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,900
Kill the bastard!

104
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:36,050
Hold!

105
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:38,620
What betrayal is this?

106
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:46,520
You cowardly animals!

107
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:51,410
Wamuu!

108
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,620
Why do that?

109
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,860
I am Wamuu.

110
00:07:56,120 --> 00:08:01,100
Although sworn to Lord Kars, I will
not allow the vampires to attack you.

111
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,420
It's not because of sentiment.

112
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:05,980
I told Caesar this as well.

113
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:09,500
To me, only the strong truly existed.

114
00:08:10,180 --> 00:08:13,080
Victory was the single
quality to be admired.

115
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:17,440
I existed only according
to my own code of honor.

116
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:20,352
Jojo, please understand.

117
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:25,380
To me, immortality was something
utterly unimportant and trivial.

118
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:31,020
All that has ever mattered to
me was living up to my code.

119
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:37,080
And now, I desire that you
should drink the antidote.

120
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:40,682
You must do it before I
dissolve completely away.

121
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,831
You won't see it, though.

122
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,620
I don't need eyes, words, or a horn.

123
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:47,100
I will know it.

124
00:08:47,380 --> 00:08:49,300
What matters is that you do it.

125
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,560
I have no regrets.

126
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:03,220
I am glad I was able to witness
your growth as a warrior.

127
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:06,590
Perhaps,

128
00:09:06,673 --> 00:09:11,421
the reason I lived these thousands of years
was so that I could meet you at the end.

129
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:19,100
Farewell to you, warrior Jojo.

130
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:30,240
Wamu became one with the wind.

131
00:09:31,140 --> 00:09:34,460
Jojo gave his opponent one final salute.

132
00:09:35,020 --> 00:09:38,860
Though no tears fell, they
had shared a silent song.

133
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:42,200
They had shared a warrior's affinity.

134
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:51,580
Cameo, you must kill him.

135
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:57,300
But, my lord Kars, with utmost respect,
he is only an innocent young boy.

136
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,900
That's true, just a boy.

137
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:02,460
That is the reason he must die.

138
00:10:02,820 --> 00:10:05,480
If these Hamon users are allowed to live,

139
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:08,017
they're likely to become
our mortal enemies.

140
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:10,720
And humans grow very quickly indeed.

141
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:12,370
Hmm.

142
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,600
Is it beyond you?

143
00:10:14,860 --> 00:10:18,040
It would seem I must
demonstrate how it is done.

144
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:23,120
Now, resolving the problem
is handled like this, Wamuu.

145
00:10:26,420 --> 00:10:27,250
Wamuu.

146
00:10:27,333 --> 00:10:30,780
He was too pure in his warrior philosophy.

147
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,340
And he became weak as a result.

148
00:10:33,660 --> 00:10:35,366
Well, that's the end of Wamuu.

149
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:36,880
Indeed it is.

150
00:10:37,060 --> 00:10:39,540
What a disappointment. You're right.

151
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,060
He's only a poser.

152
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:43,734
Your followers are such base creatures.

153
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:45,333
Makes me want to vomit.

154
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:50,560
No, don't! Don't curse me! Please!

155
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:52,340
Green, you'll try!

156
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:56,560
I alone am the only one to remain.

157
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:04,080
Because this world and
all in it belong to me.

158
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:11,117
Look at him, look!

159
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,740
Lord Kars is amazing!

160
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:16,580
Our lord is ready to fight!

161
00:11:17,700 --> 00:11:19,020
Listen, Lord Kars,

162
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:22,757
there's no reason for you to waste
time on any one-on-one battles.

163
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:23,840
Forget the rules.

164
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,797
Let us kill these two for you!

165
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:29,320
or you lord will turn
them into sprays of blood.

166
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:31,721
Just what I thought you would do.

167
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:36,020
I told you.

168
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:39,100
The red stone, look.

169
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:41,660
It's me against cars, one-on-one.

170
00:11:41,860 --> 00:11:44,117
But if those terms aren't to your liking,

171
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:47,057
why don't I just smash this
thing right here and now?

172
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,780
I will honor my word.

173
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,320
A one-on-one fight.

174
00:11:50,620 --> 00:11:52,437
Count on it, my promise stands.

175
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:56,500
That is why I chose to
reveal my horn to you.

176
00:11:56,720 --> 00:12:02,640
As for my underlings' behavior, as you
can clearly see, they are already dead.

177
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:10,060
All I want is that red stone.

178
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:15,940
However, though, ACDC and Wamuu
were my comrades for 10,000 years.

179
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:21,017
I have no choice but to honor both their
warrior deaths and their warrior pride.

180
00:12:21,100 --> 00:12:24,320
I will fight you Hamon users fairly,

181
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:28,220
and then I will finish
this with my own two hands.

182
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:30,120
For you, Lisa-Lisa,

183
00:12:30,540 --> 00:12:34,537
seeing the fighter you are, I will
not think of you as merely a woman.

184
00:12:34,620 --> 00:12:38,149
I will fight you with all the
strength I have at my command.

185
00:12:39,220 --> 00:12:40,120
Come with me.

186
00:12:40,580 --> 00:12:42,286
That is where we shall fight.

187
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:46,160
The Temple at Pies Bernina.

188
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:52,200
Champions of battle would come here to
drink the blood of those they had felled,

189
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,379
mixed with liquor.

190
00:12:53,620 --> 00:12:56,240
They thanked the gods
for the gift of life.

191
00:12:57,560 --> 00:13:01,720
It's not an arena, but it
will serve for our fight.

192
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:06,734
Coach Lisa Lisa, you may be extremely
skilled, but you are still a woman.

193
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,697
He doesn't look as strong as Wamu was.

194
00:13:08,780 --> 00:13:10,192
Let me take him for you.

195
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,580
I will not.

196
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:16,937
I didn't live my life
as I did and train all

197
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:20,800
those years to be replaced by
some stripling Oh, that's right.

198
00:13:21,020 --> 00:13:22,726
You have lived a lot of years

199
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:27,297
I shall use my brilliant bone blades.

200
00:13:27,380 --> 00:13:32,317
It would offend Wamuu's memory if I didn't
offer you the weapon of your choice!

201
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:34,680
Feel free to pick anything you like.

202
00:13:35,980 --> 00:13:38,337
My scarf will be more than sufficient.

203
00:13:38,420 --> 00:13:39,857
As you will.

204
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:42,260
And now, let's fight.

205
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:48,430
Remarkable.

206
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:51,120
There is no violence in his stance.

207
00:13:52,340 --> 00:13:54,780
How can he fight without violence?

208
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,820
What's the matter?

209
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,219
Are you not ready?

210
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,880
Apparently, the first move is mine!

211
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:09,358
He disappeared completely
in that sudden white light.

212
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:10,590
Where'd he go?

213
00:14:11,380 --> 00:14:12,497
Cause is here. I...

214
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:13,780
I can feel him.

215
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:17,780
But he seems to be coming
from above as well as below.

216
00:14:30,740 --> 00:14:32,740
Attack of the brilliant Boneblade!

217
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:35,058
Look, in the pillar there's a crack!

218
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:36,600
Snake Muffler!

219
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:41,797
What you don't know is
this Satoporosia Beetle

220
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:44,960
Scarf is able to conduct
hormone energy perfectly.

221
00:14:45,380 --> 00:14:48,340
It's both a deadly weapon
and a life detector.

222
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:51,700
And it protects against
being attacked from behind!

223
00:14:58,340 --> 00:14:59,170
Alright!

224
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:00,500
A knockout!

225
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:02,817
My wonderful coach really got him good!

226
00:15:02,900 --> 00:15:07,340
He didn't really compare to Wamuu,
but dogs who bark rarely bite.

227
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:11,214
Coach, I have to say that you
really are better than me.

228
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:16,000
Help me!

229
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:17,360
Help me, Lord Kars!

230
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:19,920
Kars is behind her!

231
00:15:20,540 --> 00:15:21,700
Then who's that?

232
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:22,959
Who's at her feet?

233
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:25,020
It can't be!

234
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:27,997
What the hell is going on?!

235
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:30,237
Kars wasn't the one fighting with her!

236
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,480
He used a double!

237
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,280
Hmph, what stupidity.

238
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:39,300
Why would I ever choose
to fight one-on-one?

239
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:42,737
The only thing I wanted out
of this was the Red Stone,

240
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:45,820
because I planned to become
the ultimate life form.

241
00:15:46,020 --> 00:15:50,600
I am not a warrior philosopher like
Wamuu was, nor am I a romantic.

242
00:15:51,620 --> 00:15:54,091
No matter the method utilized, in the end,

243
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:58,060
victory is the only thing that matters!

244
00:16:00,740 --> 00:16:03,860
So, that's why I sensed no violence.

245
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:07,260
He never had any intention of fighting me.

246
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,300
It's over!

247
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,420
Joe, Joe.

248
00:16:14,860 --> 00:16:16,700
I have the red stone.

249
00:16:17,180 --> 00:16:22,140
The only thing that's left is for all
of you to make me happy by killing Jojo.

250
00:16:28,900 --> 00:16:30,820
You are going to pay!

251
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:37,480
Out of the way! Move back!

252
00:16:37,700 --> 00:16:40,000
They took down stealth and kill you!

253
00:16:40,540 --> 00:16:41,460
Zoom punch!

254
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,720
You're homo!

255
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:49,817
I don't think it's working anymore.

256
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:51,917
You're weak now, so we're...

257
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,780
REBOB OVER DRIVE!

258
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:01,440
Jojo, you look completely worn out.

259
00:17:01,940 --> 00:17:03,700
Your breathing is ragged.

260
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:05,651
Your hamon level is weak.

261
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:07,997
And you're the only one left.

262
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:09,737
Out of all of the hamon users?

263
00:17:09,820 --> 00:17:11,480
that Lisa Lisa trained.

264
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,180
Can you last?

265
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,600
Will you last?

266
00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:19,360
Jojo, think you can Beat me?

267
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:25,630
What?

268
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:27,480
It can't be gone!

269
00:17:27,660 --> 00:17:31,560
Let's rip off his skin!
Oh, crap! You can try!

270
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:41,760
That light!

271
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:45,477
And that face!

272
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:47,740
This is your warning, vampires.

273
00:17:48,140 --> 00:17:51,880
You are now facing Major von
Stroheim und der German Elite.

274
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:58,320
And we represent the special forces of
the Speedwagon Foundation! Jojo! Jojo!

275
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:01,180
Da, Speedwagon, you look great.

276
00:18:01,340 --> 00:18:02,420
And Smokey, too.

277
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:04,420
You're a sight for sore eyes.

278
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:12,217
My right leg might be stiff now, but my
body is better than it ever was before!

279
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:16,860
Now all your vampires will see
what German science can do!

280
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:20,940
These are ultra-violent bloodlines!

281
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:26,420
It was the Speedwagon Foundation
that made them small enough to carry.

282
00:18:26,780 --> 00:18:28,800
But our boy does like to brag.

283
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:35,710
Hmm.

284
00:18:35,793 --> 00:18:37,780
Crafty creatures, no question.

285
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,230
Hmm?

286
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:42,420
I don't see Jojo down there.

287
00:18:42,620 --> 00:18:43,600
Gone again.

288
00:18:45,620 --> 00:18:48,420
Oh, you're just as quick
as ever, aren't you?

289
00:18:49,100 --> 00:18:51,060
Take eyes off you for a second.

290
00:18:51,300 --> 00:18:54,820
And there you are, putting
another little scheme in play.

291
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:57,940
You crossed a line.

292
00:18:58,200 --> 00:19:00,318
No honor earns you no consideration.

293
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:04,437
You said it would be a fair
fight, but attacked Lisa!

294
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:06,280
Lisa in a cowardly ambush?

295
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:08,998
thereby showing what you're made of.

296
00:19:09,280 --> 00:19:13,045
And you have betrayed the honor
and memory of your friend, Wamu!

297
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:14,840
Save your indignation.

298
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,780
Your outrage means nothing.

299
00:19:17,180 --> 00:19:20,340
Any action is a means to
an end for what I desire.

300
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:23,520
The thing that matters
to me is the Red Stone.

301
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:27,780
Battling over thousands of
years means minimizing danger,

302
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:31,845
not taking any risk and moving
your pawns very carefully indeed.

303
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:34,757
This is what the battle has been about.

304
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:37,680
And to show you how good I am at this,

305
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:41,880
I'm going to maneuver you effortlessly
to your death. Listen to me!

306
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:44,100
For your information, Kars!

307
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:47,720
I've never hated anyone before
this day, but you I hate!

308
00:19:47,980 --> 00:19:49,420
You really hate me?

309
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:51,480
Then show me, Jojo.

310
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,240
Let's go one-on-one.

311
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:56,186
We'll have that fair
fight you wanted to have.

312
00:19:59,620 --> 00:20:03,717
Lisa Lisa is almost dead
but not completely yet

313
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:07,297
I left her alive my plan
is to let her live for a

314
00:20:07,380 --> 00:20:12,117
while and why would I do
that she's just another

315
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:16,860
pawn a worthless little
pawn I can use against you?

316
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:29,300
You utter bastard!

317
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Now I've tied her feet
together with this rope.

318
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,540
And do you know why?

319
00:20:38,120 --> 00:20:40,600
Why would I do such a thing as this?

320
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:43,020
This is why!

321
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:46,500
Lisa Lisa no! Off you go!

322
00:20:46,860 --> 00:20:49,580
If she hits the ground, she'll be dead.

323
00:20:50,220 --> 00:20:55,800
If you don't save her in a few seconds,
she'll be a Lisa-Lisa-shaped splatter!

324
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:01,690
Huh?

325
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:04,140
What? JoJo!

326
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:06,900
Lisa-Lisa! Huh? Lisa-Lisa?

327
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,460
That Lisa-Lisa?

328
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:11,000
Do you mean to say she's the baby?

329
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:13,540
On the ship Granny Arena told us about?

330
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:19,300
then that means she is JoJo's.

331
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:26,500
Now that you can't move from that spot,
here's how efficient battle can be, JoJo.

332
00:21:27,140 --> 00:21:33,060
I'll very calmly walk right up to you and
slice you to pieces while you can't move.

333
00:21:40,380 --> 00:21:41,817
Cars, you bastard!

334
00:21:41,900 --> 00:21:44,700
There's a place waiting for you in hell!

335
00:21:45,740 --> 00:21:46,980
JoJo doesn't know.

336
00:21:47,460 --> 00:21:51,360
He doesn't know the woman he's
trying to save is his mother.

337
00:22:12,560 --> 00:22:15,600
I'll spend the day away.

338
00:22:17,900 --> 00:22:20,817
Call it morning driving through the sun.

339
00:22:20,900 --> 00:22:22,500
And in and out the valley.

340
00:22:32,320 --> 00:22:35,577
The music dance and sing.

341
00:22:35,660 --> 00:22:39,757
They make the chill and drum really ring.

342
00:22:39,840 --> 00:22:43,840
I'll spend the day your way.

343
00:22:45,360 --> 00:22:47,937
Cold in morning, driving through the sun.

344
00:22:48,020 --> 00:22:49,760
And in and out the valley.

345
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:54,380
In and out around the lake.

346
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:57,777
Mountains come out of the sky.

347
00:22:57,860 --> 00:22:59,520
And they'll stand there.

348
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:04,757
One mile over, we'll be there.

349
00:23:04,840 --> 00:23:06,220
And we'll see you.

350
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:11,257
Ten, two summers, we'll be there.

351
00:23:11,340 --> 00:23:12,740
Locking with you.

352
00:23:16,120 --> 00:23:18,317
Twenty, four, five, five, let me see.

353
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:21,160
I'll be there with you.

354
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:30,777
Have you finished disposing
of those vampires yet?

355
00:23:30,860 --> 00:23:33,177
I'm taking your life at
the moment of my choice.

356
00:23:33,260 --> 00:23:34,717
The scarf is a gamble.

357
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:35,837
Poor little child.

358
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:37,700
Von Stroheim, you must stop!

359
00:23:37,820 --> 00:23:38,680
This can't be!
